## Summary
The National Assembly passed a resolution urging the expulsion of Lee Jin-sook. This move received support from at least two members of the People Power Party, indicating political developments in Korea.

## Key Points
- The National Assembly formally passed the resolution for Lee Jin-sook's expulsion.
- At least two members of the People Power Party supported the resolution, showing political backing.
- This event is a breaking news item in Korean politics, reflecting ongoing legislative actions.


